Real occlusion queries for the deko3d renderer (from ds3-nx ds3/sdk-patches/0031, unchanged). Dead Space 2's final
fight is thought to measure how much of ghost Nicole is on screen with them; a fixed "visible" count is the suspect
for its black screen.

